"description":"\"It's perfect, honestly.\" - Myke Hurley, Connected\n\n\"What makes Sticky Widgets great is the simplicity of the experience.\" - Ryan Christoffel, MacStories\n\n\"This is a great concept.\" - Dave Mark, The Loop\n\nWelcome to Sticky Widgets, the absolute easiest way to put a sticky note on your home screen and edit it quickly. Add as many Sticky Widgets as you'd like, in every widget size. It's simple! It works on iPad! You can even pin notes to your Lock Screen with a premium subscription so they're visible even when your phone is locked!\n\n1. Add a Sticky Widget to your home screen\n2. Tap on the widget to edit it\n3. That's about it!\n\nBut that's not all. Once you have a widget in place, you can customize it: change color, background, font, alignment, size, even rotation! And your widgets now sync to your iCloud account, meaning you can put a note on multiple devices logged into the same Apple ID and they'll stay in sync.\n\nSticky Widgets supports deep system integration with Siri, Shortcuts, the Dynamic Island, and more so there are even more ways to view and update your notes and lists.\n\nSticky Widgets is free to download and use. You get unlimited widgets, three classic background colors, three fonts, iCloud sync, Siri and Shortcuts integration, and full control over alignment, size, and rotation: all without paying a thing.\n\nAn optional upgrade unlocks everything else: the full color picker with any color you want, gradients and mesh gradients, hundreds of additional fonts, custom text colors, Lock Screen pinning, separate styling for light and dark mode, saved presets, the ability to restore archived notes, scheduled reminders, and no ads. Premium features can be accessed with a monthly, quarterly, or annual subscription, or with a one-time purchase.\n\nThe Sticky Widgets Terms of Use and Privacy Policy can be found at https://www.tylerhillsman.com/privacy-sw/. The Apple EULA can be found at https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "trackCensoredName":"Sticky Widgets", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/sticky-widgets/id1533254320?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.5707000000000004291678123991005122661590576171875, "genreIds":["6002", "6007"], "genres":["Utilities", "Productivity"], "userRatingCount":29562}]
